{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Goerss–Hopkins–Miller定理"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“Goerss–Hopkins–Miller 定理”"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p>存在椭圆曲线 (形式群律) 到 "},{"Local":{"url":"E∞-环","text":"E∞-环"}},{"Plain":"的函子性的对应, 以表现椭圆曲线对应的"},{"Local":{"url":"椭圆上同调","text":"椭圆上同调"}},{"Plain":"理论. 这使得"},{"Local":{"url":"椭圆曲线的模叠","text":"椭圆曲线的模叠"}},{"Plain":"带有一个 E∞-环结构层. 这个函子的极限, 即结构层的全局截面, 是 "},{"Local":{"url":"tmf","text":"tmf"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}